# ── not provisioned by docker-compose.ci.yml ─────────────────────────────────────
# Defined so no task_config.ini can fail on an undefined variable; the suites that use them
# skip on the TCP probe (or fail loudly under DT_TESTS_STRICT_ENV=1, which is exactly why the
# nightly matrix only sets that flag for the suites whose stack is fully provisioned above).
